{"4899190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lifebearers", "steam_appid": 4899190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND, RESCUE, AND EXTRACT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/b6c31f243de952ecf8b7ed162ee05d42.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/b6c31f243de952ecf8b7ed162ee05d42.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/b6c31f243de952ecf8b7ed162ee05d42.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the battlefield for wounded soldiers trapped between collapsing buildings, sniper fire, and relentless explosions. Grab a stretcher and carry them to the nearest safe evacuation zone. Every second counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T LET GO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/24de6f23f63fb6a81522f862a876c298.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/24de6f23f63fb6a81522f862a876c298.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/24de6f23f63fb6a81522f862a876c298.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is alive and constantly changing. Keeping your patient alive is just as important as finding them. Escort the wounded soldier all the way to safety to complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Preferably in one piece.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOMBS, EXPLOSIONS, AND SMOKE SCREENS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/1236c1617e52aa27d364513840583d94.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/1236c1617e52aa27d364513840583d94.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/1236c1617e52aa27d364513840583d94.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just racing against time—the battlefield itself is trying to stop you. Airstrikes, tanks, enemy soldiers, artillery, and countless other threats stand between you and safety. One wrong move could leave you buried under the next explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR UP. STAY ALIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/31ce79cd3b00fe0145bbe231eccc817d.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/31ce79cd3b00fe0145bbe231eccc817d.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/31ce79cd3b00fe0145bbe231eccc817d.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great combat medic doesn't just save lives—they do it fast. Stay calm, adapt to the situation, and use special equipment to survive the front lines. Sometimes a single smoke grenade is all it takes to save a life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...if you know how to use it.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND, RESCUE, AND EXTRACT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/b6c31f243de952ecf8b7ed162ee05d42.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/b6c31f243de952ecf8b7ed162ee05d42.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/b6c31f243de952ecf8b7ed162ee05d42.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the battlefield for wounded soldiers trapped between collapsing buildings, sniper fire, and relentless explosions. Grab a stretcher and carry them to the nearest safe evacuation zone. Every second counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DON'T LET GO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/24de6f23f63fb6a81522f862a876c298.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/24de6f23f63fb6a81522f862a876c298.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/24de6f23f63fb6a81522f862a876c298.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is alive and constantly changing. Keeping your patient alive is just as important as finding them. Escort the wounded soldier all the way to safety to complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Preferably in one piece.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOMBS, EXPLOSIONS, AND SMOKE SCREENS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/1236c1617e52aa27d364513840583d94.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/1236c1617e52aa27d364513840583d94.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/1236c1617e52aa27d364513840583d94.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just racing against time—the battlefield itself is trying to stop you. Airstrikes, tanks, enemy soldiers, artillery, and countless other threats stand between you and safety. One wrong move could leave you buried under the next explosion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR UP. STAY ALIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/31ce79cd3b00fe0145bbe231eccc817d.poster.avif?t=1786021155\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/31ce79cd3b00fe0145bbe231eccc817d.webm?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4899190/extras/31ce79cd3b00fe0145bbe231eccc817d.mp4?t=1786021155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great combat medic doesn't just save lives—they do it fast. Stay calm, adapt to the situation, and use special equipment to survive the front lines. Sometimes a single smoke grenade is all it takes to save a life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >